<lb n="75"/>caution so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leisten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnuog</unclear>-
<lb n="76"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">samb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versichret</unclear>. So erbiotten wir unß dahin
<lb n="77"/>das auf alle fahl wir euch als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obrigkheit</unclear>
<lb n="78"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißorts</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgers</unclear>, gegen
